{"slug":"paijat-hame","name":"Päijät-Häme","cards":[{"id":54429,"sci":"Ribes uva-crispa","fi":"Hillokarviainen","group":"Plantae","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/30123059/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/30123059/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Arnold Wijker, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Arnold Wijker","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karviainen","summary":"<b>Karviainen</b> eli <b>hillokarviainen</b> (<i>Ribes uva-crispa</i>) on herukoiden sukuun kuuluva marjapensas, jonka alkuperäinen esiintymisalue on Euroopassa ja Aasian länsiosissa. Pohjoismaissa karviaista tavataan viljelyjäänteenä ja viljelykarkulaisena. Karviainen on vakinainen uustulokas Suomen, Ruotsin ja Norjan keskiosiin asti ja satunnainen pohjoisempanakin. Karviaislajikkeita on kelta-, puna- ja vihreämarjaisia, joiden maku on erilainen. Amerikassa ja Aasiassa on lukuisia muita karviaislajeja, joiden marjoja alkuasukkaat ovat syöneet mutta joita ei yleensä viljellä.","spread":7876,"m":[0,0,0,0,5,5,2,2,0,1,0,0],"s":[[60.97676,25.68684],[60.97833,25.67435],[61.00456,26.00771],[60.94909,25.8884]]},{"id":129027,"sci":"Exidia recisa","fi":"Pajuhytykkä","group":"Fungi","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/11650520/medium.jpeg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/11650520/square.jpeg","attribution":"(c) Almantas Kulbis, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Almantas Kulbis","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exidia_recisa","summary":"","spread":10939,"m":[2,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,3,2,0],"s":[[60.84598,25.66261],[60.84602,25.66245],[60.86022,25.66738],[61.0054,26.0055]]},{"id":168349,"sci":"Salix pentandra","fi":"Halava","group":"Plantae","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/48656124/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/48656124/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Alexey P. Seregin, some righ